    },
    {
        "text": "Everything you could ever want is right here."
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment of peace you've longed for. A land without warfare, the embrace of your mother."
    },
    {
        "text": "Your consciousness expands limitlessly, breaking its shackles. You are free."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "What is freedom?;I'm free!",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Broadly speaking, to be free is a relative state, free from constraints. However, people who say this are often constrained by their flesh."
    },
    {
        "text": "But you are truly free."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, my dear friend. You are free, and you forever will be."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "You are a resolute stone in the river of time. Though your responsibilities, fate, desires, and attachments may all be washed away, you, and only you, will always exist here."
    },
    {
        "text": "You are beholden to nothing, and nothing is beholden to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "There is nothing better than this!;Responsibilities. Fate. Desires. Attachments...",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "You understand everything. Right now, you are speaking to an unfathomable being. Gaze in awe and offer up your purest blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe you have merely been hit on the head and fallen into a state of unconsciousness. You are simply carrying out a meaningless conversation with an imaginary self."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I want to build my kingdom here!;No, on second thought, I'm more of a masochist.",
            "values": "3;4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "A wise decision, my King. This place is broader than Terra itself, and you can build whatever you wish here."
    },
    {
        "text": "First of all, let's found a country. How about naming it the Land of Existence?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The country raised on the banks of Nothingness shall last a thousand years\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, pardon me. It seems that our noble cause must come to an end here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like a ray of light that shines through the curtains, a strong sense of discomfort suddenly invades your consciousness."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 4
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "You love pain. You like exhaustion. You enjoy plunging into the flames. You relish getting hurt."
    },
    {
        "text": "Smart people are forever seeking a failure that is just right, some loss that can be aptly contained. They believe this is the best way to help themselves grow."
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not become conceited, my dear Secretary of the Nothingness Department."
    },
    {
        "text": "Well then. Firstly, let's grant you some of that pain that you love oh so much\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "From every nook and cranny of your flesh, comes the sensation of extreme soreness."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Soldier, you have borne countless pains, witnessed innumerable failures. There is little that brings you joy."
    },
    {
        "text": "But that is exactly what has allowed you to come this far. They are a poison, shackles upon your self. They will never let you know peace."
    },
    {
        "text": "Some things can never be taken back. Some things you need not burden yourself with."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You're right. It's time for me to rest.;No, there are people waiting for me.",
            "values": "5;6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 5
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, my dear. That is how it should be."
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. I will sing to you a lullaby, and you shall rest in eternal sleep, undisturbed forevermore."
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet, just as you fall into slumber, a powerful sensation assaults you\u2014\u2014pain!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 6
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I see. I do admit they are all good children."
    },
    {
        "text": "But did you ever consider that even without you, those kids will still be able to move forward? You are not responsible for them."
    },
    {
        "text": "Your responsibilities. Your fate. Your desires. Your connection to them. Are they but a delusion of yours?"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fine. Since you have already made your decision, I shall grant you a surprise. That's right, it is none other than the pain you love so much!"
    },
    {
        "text": "From every nook and cranny of your flesh, comes the sensation of extreme soreness."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "3;4;5;6"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "What follows is a distant yet familiar voice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "...D-Doctor!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya? No, no. This voice is far more mature than Amiya's."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Still sleeping after all this time, huh? Why do you do this to me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
