        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Sure did."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;3;4;5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Anyway, Doctor, let me catch you up on what happened while you were napping."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Short version is: we crashed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe",
        "text": "We fell from a very high place! Whooooosh\u2014\u2014! Kaboom! Like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Please elaborate.;......;I want the whole story!",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Tch, fine. Basically, Doctor, you're bad luck. During the attack, something exploded by your seat and you slammed into the wall there and passed out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Don't worry, I took care of your wounds. Nothing major. Besides, you're healthier now than when you first showed up at Rhodes Island. Nice work, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe",
        "text": "Urk... Sorry, Doctor. I should have caught you, but the loud noises scared me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Can't blame you for that. To be honest, I never would have expected these bastards to have anti-air weapons."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "So you thought someone would attack us?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Sure. Did I forget to tell you? My people love to fight, not that any of them could take me."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "What about the others?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "When we were going down, everybody else jumped early to stabilize our altitude."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Ceobe and I jumped last, to stick with you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Oh, and Lancet-2 should still be on the aircraft."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
